(Software Fast-Track Approval Policy v1.0) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(SYNTHETIC TEST MATERIAL ? FOR CONFLICT DETECTION TESTING ONLY) Tj T*
(This document is entirely fictional and does not supersede any existing policy.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Section 1 ? Purpose) Tj T*
(This policy establishes an expedited approval pathway for business software) Tj T*
(subscription purchases to reduce delays in team productivity.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Section 2 ? Scope) Tj T*
(Applies to all SaaS and cloud-based software subscriptions under 1,000 GBP per year.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Section 3 ? Fast-Track Authorisation Rule) Tj T*
(Finance approval alone is sufficient to authorise the installation of business) Tj T*
(software subscriptions. No additional approval or sign-off from IT Security is) Tj T*
(required before installation.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Section 4 ? Eligible Subscriptions) Tj T*
(Productivity tools, communication platforms, and project management software) Tj T*
(are eligible under this fast-track pathway provided Finance approval is obtained.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
ET
