(Software Fast-Track Approval Policy v1.0 ? Page 2) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(SYNTHETIC TEST MATERIAL ? FOR CONFLICT DETECTION TESTING ONLY) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Section 5 ? Approval Process) Tj T*
(Step 1: Employee submits a software request to their line manager.) Tj T*
(Step 2: Line manager forwards the request to Finance for budget approval.) Tj T*
(Step 3: Finance signs off and notifies the employee.) Tj T*
(Step 4: Employee may install the approved subscription immediately after) Tj T*
(        Finance sign-off. No IT Security review is required at any step.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Section 6 ? Record Keeping) Tj T*
(Finance must maintain a log of all fast-track approvals for audit purposes.) Tj T*
(Records must be retained for a minimum of five years.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Section 7 ? Review Cycle) Tj T*
(This policy will be reviewed annually by the Finance Director.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
ET
